To set up the wm (in a nested window) you need to run the smallvil.sh script. The script will then download necessary packages and build the WM in ~/Documents/Rust/. To run the project after the script is done do: 'cargo run --release'.

The project uses a config file located in ~/.config/smallvil. You can change keybingdings and add more functions in there. If you are not using KDE Plasma, you will need to change the terminal command to be something else.
You also need to open ~/Documents/Rust/smallvil/src/main.rs at 61:40 and change "zsh" to the command to summon your terminal
